OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland's former owner offers to
OL,4,Ainvest in firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoundland's former owner has said he
OL,7,Fwould invest in the firm as a
OL,8,Fgovernment minister said she would meet
OL,9,Fthe firm's board.
OL,11,FSteve Smith, who founded the
OL,12,FWalsall-based business, leaving it in
OL,13,F2006, said he had attempted to contact
OL,14,Fowners Gordon Brothers having been
OL,15,F"really surprised" to learn about them
OL,16,Ffiling for administration when sales
OL,17,Fwere up 11% on last year.
