OL,3,GNEWSAPoundland's former owner offers to
OL,4,Ainvest in firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC understands that Business
OL,7,FMinister Kate Dearden will meet with
OL,8,Fsenior Poundland executives later this
OL,9,Fweek to discuss the company's
OL,10,Fthreatened insolvency.
OL,12,FUS-based Gordon Brothers said it was
OL,13,Fevaluating interest for the whole
OL,14,Fbusiness and formal and indicative
OL,15,Foffers for significant viable parts of
OL,16,Fit.
